{"id":"torrey:affliction-prayer-under","source":"torrey","name":"Affliction, Prayer Under","slug":"affliction-prayer-under","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Exhortation to — Jas 5:13.","refs":[["Jas",5,13,5,13]]},{"text":"That God would consider our trouble — 2Ki 19:16; Ne 9:32; Ps 9:13; La 5:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,16,19,16],["Neh",9,32,9,32],["Ps",9,13,9,13],["Lam",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"For the presence and support of God — Ps 10:1; 102:2.","refs":[["Ps",10,1,10,1],["Ps",102,2,102,2]]},{"text":"That the Holy Spirit may not be withdrawn — Ps 51:11.","refs":[["Ps",51,11,51,11]]},{"text":"For divine comfort — Ps 4:6; 119:76.","refs":[["Ps",4,6,4,6],["Ps",119,76,119,76]]},{"text":"For mitigation of troubles — Ps 39:12,13.","refs":[["Ps",39,12,39,12],["Ps",39,13,39,13]]},{"text":"For deliverance — Ps 25:17,22; 39:10; Isa 64:9-12; Jer 17:14.","refs":[["Ps",25,17,25,17],["Ps",25,22,25,22],["Ps",39,10,39,10],["Isa",64,9,64,12],["Jer",17,14,17,14]]},{"text":"For pardon and deliverance from sin — Ps 39:8; 51:1; 79:8.","refs":[["Ps",39,8,39,8],["Ps",51,1,51,1],["Ps",79,8,79,8]]},{"text":"That we may be turned to God — Ps 80:7; 85:4-6; Jer 31:18.","refs":[["Ps",80,7,80,7],["Ps",85,4,85,6],["Jer",31,18,31,18]]},{"text":"For divine teaching and direction — Job 34:32; Ps 27:11; 143:10.","refs":[["Job",34,32,34,32],["Ps",27,11,27,11],["Ps",143,10,143,10]]},{"text":"For increase of faith — Mr 9:24.","refs":[["Mark",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"For mercy — Ps 6:2; Hab 3:2.","refs":[["Ps",6,2,6,2],["Hab",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"For restoration to joy — Ps 51:8,12; 69:29; 90:14,15.","refs":[["Ps",51,8,51,8],["Ps",51,12,51,12],["Ps",69,29,69,29],["Ps",90,14,90,14],["Ps",90,15,90,15]]},{"text":"For protection and preservation from enemies — 2Ki 19:19; 2Ch 20:12; Ps 17:8,9.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,19,19,19],["2Chr",20,12,20,12],["Ps",17,8,17,8],["Ps",17,9,17,9]]},{"text":"That we may know the causes of our trouble — Job 6:24; 10:2; 13:23,24.","refs":[["Job",6,24,6,24],["Job",10,2,10,2],["Job",13,23,13,23],["Job",13,24,13,24]]},{"text":"That we may be taught the uncertainty of life — Ps 39:4.","refs":[["Ps",39,4,39,4]]},{"text":"That we may be quickened — Ps 143:11.","refs":[["Ps",143,11,143,11]]}],"refCount":44}
